2 Getting Started: Installation and First Speech
************************************************

This chapter takes you from a fresh source checkout to a speaking
Emacsvox session.  You will prepare the speech server, build Emacsvox,
check each layer, and start an isolated session before changing your
personal Emacs setup.

   Commands shown before Emacsvox starts are entered in a terminal.
Keys written with ‘C-’ or ‘M-’ are entered inside Emacs.  The same
chapter is available before installation at
<https://bartbunting.github.io/emacsvox/Installation.html>.

